      "call.arg1 and call.arg2 arrive with their quote bytes and there is no arg1_text, so the URL of r.Handle(\"GET\", \"/legacy\", h) and the served directory of r.Static(\"/assets\", \"./public\") cannot be an identity; Handle/Match routes are keyed by where they are written, and a static mount records only its URL prefix.",
